		{
			dependencies: ["4A47FB945C0C4886"]
			description: [
				"Tales speak of a gem found in the deepest of the ocean, forged by frost and fear."
				"If you wander the maze in search of this &6&oAbyssal Amethyst&r, and hear vibrations under the icey ground below, beware, for &6&oThe Mother of The Maze&r has come for you. Powerful in her persuit, and said to be capable of breaking the very ice that separates you, killing her is said to be hard... but &6&operhaps not impossible&r."
			]
			id: "47116E8A4D078C0B"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "33BFE9CE79959E22"
				item: "aquamirae:abyssal_amethyst"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Kill mother of maze"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4A47FB945C0C4886"]
			description: [
				"Just what is &o&6the Maw&r if not a trap of sharp teeth and malformed fins. The sightings of these creatures, and the findings of those slain, many find only their fins and bones to be of use, although some say they've heard &6&oechoes of those killed in the icey depths&r. Some sightings claim to see items within the mouths of the Maws, as if to lure in adventurers to a sharp and cold end."
				"It seems like The Maw is &6&onot the only source of these&r, however, and they may make for some useful crafting material."
			]
			id: "3D23AD9F4C0A2BE3"
			rewards: [{
